## Source pointer

Full rules: `~/projects/galawork/galawork-packages/event4u/agent-config/.agent-src/rules/`.
The 12 above are the "always-on" tier per Spike 0.4. The other 65 rules are
**context-active** — load only when their trigger keywords appear in the prompt
or in the open file. Not compiled here because the always-on Cursor `.cursorrules`
file pays full token cost on every turn.
